    <string name="dialog_clear_all_title">Clear every CarrierConfig test override?</string>
    <string name="dialog_clear_all_body">Removes transient and persistent CarrierConfig test values on sub %1$d, including values written by other tools. It does not restore the Network layer and cannot rebuild another tool\'s values.</string>
